<!--
  Themed (monochrome) launcher layer: the same A, road and plug as one flat silhouette.

  The launcher tints this layer with a single system colour, so every part shares one fill.
  The geometry matches ic_launcher_foreground, so a themed icon is the same mark in a
  different colour rather than a second, approximate design. The dark road ribbon is
  dropped: as a monochrome layer it would be invisible, and the lane dashes already read
  as the road.
-->
